      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline alloy exhibits brittle room-temperature behavior with elongation below 1%.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 2-5 at.% Al to Hf-Mo-Ta-Ti-Zr may induce a secondary B2 or Laves intermetallic phase.",
